        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Dragon robe of silk tapestry (<i>kesi</i>), on a red background pattern of cloud forms, the eight attributes of the Daoist Immortals, lotus flowers, five-clawed dragons, a wide lower border of water and mountains. The skirts are split on either side as far as the waist. The robe is lined with dark blue silk."@en ;
